id|cell_03
title|Kaito the Warrior
v_from|13
v_to|16
scenes|scene_06_shadow_syndicate.txt;scene_07_deal_with_kaito.txt
beat|Introduce Kaito, a warrior who commanded many loyal men, whose reputation was known throughout the region. Some regarded him as a protector, others as a criminal; yet all agreed he was dangerous when opposed. Kaito had also come to the city, for he had learned of the weapon and desired to secure it before it fell into the hands of his enemies. Many paths thus converged upon the same place, though few understood how their destinies were about to become intertwined.

